Well, do you know where I can get in touch with him?

00:59:03.980 --> 00:59:05.200
Never mind. I'll try later.

00:59:08.620 --> 00:59:11.930
Yeah? He left here a couple of hours ago.

00:59:12.110 --> 00:59:14.780
He did? See if I can find him.

00:59:16.560 --> 00:59:19.750
Oh, Vicki. Hey, Vicki. I've got a call for you.

00:59:22.370 --> 00:59:24.300
Thanks. Yes?

00:59:24.910 --> 00:59:27.980
Hello, Vicki. I called your house, and when I didn't get an answer, I...

00:59:27.980 --> 00:59:29.980
I'm glad you found me, Larry. I must be...

00:59:30.820 --> 00:59:31.300
All right.

00:59:32.060 --> 00:59:32.700
I'm at home.

00:59:32.940 --> 00:59:33.640
Why don't you come over?

00:59:34.220 --> 00:59:35.100
I'll be right there, Larry.

00:59:58.790 --> 00:59:59.210
Someplace?

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:00.220
Yeah.

01:00:01.400 --> 01:00:02.940
I think we'd better take a little run down the headquarters.

01:00:03.940 --> 01:00:04.900
Finally got around him with you, huh?

01:00:05.500 --> 01:00:06.120
some more routine

01:00:06.710 --> 01:00:06.990
No?

01:00:07.390 --> 01:00:07.850
this time.

01:00:09.210 --> 01:00:11.210
I wouldn't take this too lightly if I were you lucky.

01:00:12.540 --> 01:00:15.020
We found some of your fingerprints in Lucille's apartment.

01:00:15.750 --> 01:00:17.170
Also, some of Larry Craig's.

01:00:18.490 --> 01:00:19.710
pick up Craig on the way in.

01:00:20.950 --> 01:00:21.970
Yeah, I can understand that.

01:00:22.650 --> 01:00:25.370
Ceele was sick last week and I dropped by to see if there was anything I could do for it.

01:00:26.870 --> 01:00:28.650
Now, you can explain that down at headquarters.

01:00:29.620 --> 01:00:29.900
Come on.

01:01:27.540 --> 01:01:28.620
back to Lucille's apartment.

01:01:29.180 --> 01:01:29.860
I have no idea.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.480
had something to do with Norma's murder.

01:01:40.580 --> 01:01:41.960
I found this on our dressing table.

01:01:43.110 --> 01:01:44.010
Just Captain Brown.

01:01:44.550 --> 01:01:45.950
I know, I tried to get in touch with him.

01:01:47.180 --> 01:01:47.620
Thank you very much.

01:01:48.870 --> 01:01:49.870
Let's come over here.

01:01:54.860 --> 01:01:55.100
Later.

01:02:01.240 --> 01:02:02.360
Dear Captain Brown,

01:02:02.900 --> 01:02:05.500
I'm afraid for my life, so I'm leaving the city.

01:02:06.620 --> 01:02:09.860
If anything happens to me, I want you to know who's responsible.

01:02:11.190 --> 01:02:14.010
I foolishly alibied for the murder of Norma Craig.

01:02:15.060 --> 01:02:15.900
The murderers...

01:02:20.790 --> 01:02:20.970
Thank you.

01:02:21.820 --> 01:02:22.360
You knew that?

01:02:23.830 --> 01:02:24.470
The SEAL told you.

01:02:25.340 --> 01:02:27.340
I strangled Norma because I wanted to marry you.

01:02:28.340 --> 01:02:29.980
I killed Lucille because she talked too much.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:30.220
Thank you very much.

01:02:32.070 --> 01:02:34.150
I tried to get you to keep out of this, but you wouldn't listen to me.

01:02:34.190 --> 01:02:34.810
Mary, you're mad.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:01.220
He had a perfect alibi.

01:03:02.660 --> 01:03:03.300
Too perfect.

01:03:04.650 --> 01:03:05.770
I guess that clears you, Lucky.

01:03:07.240 --> 01:03:08.660
Tell me, just out of curiosity,

01:03:09.890 --> 01:03:12.830
why did you refuse to admit you saw Craig in the club that night?

01:03:13.870 --> 01:03:15.250
Well, I had to have an alibi myself.

01:03:15.910 --> 01:03:17.450
I got a frantic phone call from Norma.

01:03:17.490 --> 01:03:18.670
By the time I got there, she was dead.

01:03:19.700 --> 01:03:22.180
I'd been up there a little early to pay her back that $10,000 I borrowed.

01:03:23.260 --> 01:03:25.760
Besides that, I went back to pick up my fountain pen that I'd left there.

01:03:27.140 --> 01:03:29.670
See, for a while, it looked pretty bad.

01:03:30.440 --> 01:03:31.060
Yeah, I know.

01:03:33.930 --> 01:03:36.870
I wonder if you'd be expecting too much if I asked you to take Miss McGuire home.

01:03:38.540 --> 01:03:38.820
Boom.

01:03:39.880 --> 01:03:41.260
She promises not to spy on me.

01:03:42.570 --> 01:03:43.350
I'll do my best.
